yaad laila ko jawan' bete ki tadpati hai <br>
jab bhi masjid se azaano'n ki sada aati hai<br>
<br>
roze aashoor jo maqtal me sada goonji thi <br>
ab bhi mehfoos hai dil me wo azaa'n akber ki <br>
dil tadapta hai to khoo'n aankho'n se barsaati hai<br>
<br>
jis ko armanou se atthara baras pala tha <br>
dasht me jalti zamee'n par tha usi ka lasha <br>
siskiyaa'n leke wo zainab se lipat jaati hai<br>
<br>
dard aisa hai bhala khud ko sambhale kaise <br>
jab mussale pe wo aati hai ibadat ke liye <br>
muztarib hoti hai deewaro'n se takraati hai<br>
<br>
shadi akber ki karu'n thi ye tammana meri <br>
karbala me hai magar lutgayi duniya meri <br>
khud se tanhaayi me roro ke ye farmaati hai<br>
<br>
ghar to veeran huwa jaan jo akber ne di <br>
haa'n magar deen-e-mohammed ko jawani dedi <br>
apne dil ko yehi kehti huwi samjhaati hai<br>
<br>
gham wo paya hai ke nazro'n me dhuwa'n hai abtak <br>
qalb-e-madar mai jo paiwast sina'n hai abtak <br>
kabhi roti kabhi ghash khaake wo girjaati hai<br>
<br>
charsoo ab hai andhera ke ujaala na raha <br>
haaye ghurbat ke zaeefi ka sahara na raha <br>
sonchte sonchte ek dam se wo ghabraati hai<br>
<br>
kya baya'n honge bhala hamse masayeb wo kamaal <br>
baad-e- akber tha qayamat umme laila ka haal <br>
wo tadap ab bhi azadarou ko rulvaati hai<br>
